==English==

====Etymolgy====
From Greek roots, ultimately [[en-]] + [[μέτρον]] (''[[metron]]''), "of proper measure", + [[-opia]], "vision"

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The condition of perfect [[vision]], where images are correctly brought to a focus on the [[retina]].

